<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets NZ$100 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets NZ$100 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hambros and LB Rheinland-Pfalz.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    15.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p> PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
